    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vigilante</strong> is an immersive <strong>interactive fiction adventure</strong> presented in a <strong>graphic novel</strong> style. Step into the role of The Vigilante on a relentless hunt for a ruthless drug lord and a sadistic serial killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, <strong>you control the narrative</strong>\u2014every decision you make shapes your path. Choose wisely, as your actions can unlock new storylines, forge unexpected alliances, or lead you to a sudden, deadly end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>multiple branching storylines</strong>, <strong>life-and-death decisions</strong>, and <strong>several unique endings</strong>, this is more than just a story\u2014it's <strong>your own gripping, choose-your-own-adventure</strong>. Read, decide, and <strong>become The Vigilante</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vigilante</strong> is an immersive <strong>interactive fiction adventure</strong> presented in a <strong>graphic novel</strong> style. Step into the role of The Vigilante on a relentless hunt for a ruthless drug lord and a sadistic serial killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, <strong>you control the narrative</strong>\u2014every decision you make shapes your path. Choose wisely, as your actions can unlock new storylines, forge unexpected alliances, or lead you to a sudden, deadly end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>multiple branching storylines</strong>, <strong>life-and-death decisions</strong>, and <strong>several unique endings</strong>, this is more than just a story\u2014it's <strong>your own gripping, choose-your-own-adventure</strong>. Read, decide, and <strong>become The Vigilante</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Vigilante is a gripping interactive graphic novel where your choices shape the story. Hunt a deadly drug lord and serial killer. Every decision matters\u2014some lead to new paths, others to your demise. With branching storylines and multiple endings, choose your fate and live with it.",
